              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lukajarak ŋul luoŋon kejaas ŋolidiopet abebenoka akanykape, kileleba akonye iwaitin kere, kotoma da, kwabo mam iyeŋete paaran ka kuare da ayoore ebe,",
